  "steps": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C) and line 2 baking sheets with parchment.",
    "Toss the potato rounds with 2 tbsp olive oil and 1/2 tsp salt and lay them in a single layer on the sheets.",
    "Bake until golden and crisp at the edges and tender inside, 25 to 35 min, flipping once halfway and swapping the sheets between racks.",
    "While the potatoes bake, finely chop the onion, parsley, dill, bell pepper and gherkins and slice the spring onions. Put them in a large bowl.",
    "Whisk the 50 ml olive oil with the pomegranate molasses, lemon juice, paprika and 1/2 tsp salt, pour over the vegetables and toss.",
    "Add the hot potatoes, toss gently and serve immediately while they are still crisp."
  ],
  "tips": [
    "Dress the potatoes only at the last minute; they soften as they sit."
  ],
